    "text": "Introduction:\nWe at Arvind recognize the significance of travel as a crucial component of our business operations. As a large conglomerate, efficiently\nmanaging our business and official travel is of utmost importance. It is imperative for us to prioritize the implementation of a highly\nefficient and automated travel and expense management tool that eliminates manual interventions and dependencies, providing our\nemployees with a seamless experience. Furthermore, we seek a tool that offers a comprehensive dashboard to monitor travel activities\nand optimize costs. With this objective in mind, we are proud to announce our partnership with Make My Trip’s (MMT) “myBiz,” the pioneers\nin India’s online travel industry. “myBiz” serves as a one-stop solution, providing a comprehensive travel solution tailored specifically for\ncorporate needs.",
