    "text": "Scope:\nThe scope of this policy encompasses all employees of Arvind Limited and its subsidiary companies, collectively referred to as the\n“Company” within the policy document.\nFurthermore, this policy extends to cover consultants, visitors, and candidates whose travel expenses are borne by the Company.\nIt applies specifically to domestic travel exceeding a distance of 300 km. For travel distances less than 300 km, please refer to the\nLocal Conveyance Policy for the applicable guidelines pertaining to travel.\nIt’s important to note that relocations, deputations, and projects are not included within the scope of this policy. Separate provisions\nand guidelines will be established for such travel scenarios.",
