    "text": "WOMEN SPECIFIC SAFETY POLICIES:\na. Hotel Entitlements: Women employees up to the M3-H1 grade thresholds are explicitly eligible to book hotels matching the next higher grade tier to guarantee secure, suitable properties.\nb. Accommodation: Women are strongly advised to avoid service apartments or company guest houses, opting for proper hotels that feature enhanced on-site security operations.\nc. Late Hour Travel: Women employees are advised to avoid late-night travel layouts whenever possible to protect personal safety.\nTOUR CANCELLATION, NO-SHOW & DELAYS:\na. Cancellations can be executed directly inside the myBiz SBT or via their corporate support center. Vendor rules apply; unapproved late cancellations result in financial recovery from the individual.\nb. No-Show Charges: If an individual misses their flight, all no-show penalty costs are recovered directly from the employee.\nc. Flight Delays: If a flight is delayed by more than 3 hours from Estimated Time of Departure (ETD), modification or cancellation can be managed freely via myBiz.",
