    "chunkType": "rule",
    "text": "ACCOMMODATION & CONVEYANCE COMPLIANCE:\nSame-Day Return: If a trip is completed on the same date it started, overnight hotel or guest house accommodation is prohibited (except temporary daytime access to a guest house/service apartment to freshen up).\nLodging & Boarding Limits: Scaled on a 24-hour cycle inclusive of taxes. Spontaneous bookings should claim state-specific corporate GST registrations.\nConveyance: App-based solutions (Ola, Uber, BluSmart) are mandatory for airport/point drops. Full-day cab hires are permitted only if moving across 3+ distinct locations in one single day or when zero return taxi services exist at the target drop point. Cabs should be shared among employees when heading to overlapping destinations.\nFlat Rate Allowance: Employees choosing self-arranged accommodation receive a flat allowance equal to 30% of their standard policy tier entitlement. Grades BM-H7 and above receive a fixed Rs. 6,000 per day flat rate.\nOther Costs: Web check-ins and express boarding options are completely non-reimbursable. Extra baggage claims require official receipts showing business needs. Laundry costs are covered on actuals if the trip duration surpasses 3 consecutive days.",
