    "text": "TERMS & CONDITIONS: All new recruits will be eligible for either a Pre-Joining Visit OR Post Joining Visit Pre Joining Visit: The employee concerned and his/her spouse shall be eligible for a pre joining visit to location of posting for fixing up accommodation, school admission etc. for a maximum period of 3 days. The concerned employee shall be reimbursed to and fro travelling expenses for self and family (self & spouse. Children allowed in case of school admission) Post Joining Visit / Joining Leave: In case if the employee has not availed a pre-joining visit then the employee concerned shall be eligible for 3 days leave to visit the location from where he/she is relocating after joining. The concerned employee shall be reimbursed one time travelling expenses for self and family as per Company Travel Policy. Transportation of Personal Packers & Household Goods: The payment for this shall be against actuals for all employees on relocation. The company shall directly make payment of eligible charges to the employee. Amount for transportation of personal packers & household goods (including cost of transportation charges, packing, unpacking, loading, unloading, services tax & Insurance): If distance between employee’s current location and the location of posting is less than 700 kms; then maximum limit is Rs. 50 per km Actuals whichever is lesser + Income tax shall be grossed up for the employee based on his tax bracket. If distance between employee’s current location and the location of posting is more than 700 kms; then maximum limit is Rs. 60 per km OR Actuals whichever is lesser + Income tax shall be grossed up for the employee based on his tax bracket. Amount of transportation of car (Only one per employee shall be allowed): In case if the car is been transported via Packers & Movers, then Rs. 10.0 per km based on the total distance shall be reimbursed to the employee. Accommodation: In case if the employee chooses to drive the car on his/her own / hire a driver then s/he shall be reimbursed mileage of Rs. 10.0 per km + Toll Charges On Actuals + driver’s wages as below + Lodging & boarding charges as per the domestic travel policy as mentioned in Annexure B. Driver’s wages to be reimbursed as below: For 8 hours Trip : Rs. 600/- After 8 hours: Rs. 50/- per hour Food: Max limit to be Rs. 200/- per meal. Temporary accommodation for the new recruit and his/her family would be provided as below (Please refer to Domestic Travel Policy for further details): The Company shall reimburse expenses incurred for relocating \"Family\" (\"Family\" shall include spouse, children and dependent parents). Travel: Flight tickets shall be booked by Arvind Travel Desk only. Any exceptions to the same shall have to be approved by the CEO / CHRO. Cab / Radio Taxi (To be arranged in case of outstation employee/s) : Brokerage: One month rent to be paid if HRA as a reimbursement against brokerage receipt. This shall be allowable to paid only once during the employee’s employment with Arvind and benefit is available maximum for 1 year from the date of the joining of the employee. House Deposit: To be paid as an advance to the employee and recovered in 10 equal monthly instalments (interest free) Reimbursements: Joining Expense (Notice Pay Buyout / Variable Pay / Joining Bonus): Based on management approval, this is payable on submission of a full & final settlement proof from the previous organization. Any amount which is over and above the approved limits shall require a special sanction from the CEO for businesses / Corporate HR Head for corporate functions. In case if employee quits within 1 year of joining, the same (Joining Bonus",
