    "section": "OBJECTIVE, SCOPE & CAR CLAUSES",
    "chunkType": "rule",
    "text": "LOCAL CONVEYANCE POLICY\nObjective: Govern the reimbursement process for local conveyance. Payout is allowed strictly for travel undertaken for official work purposes at an office location other than the employee's regular assigned place of work.\nApplicability: Applies to all Management and staff cadre employees under the Arvind Corporate business unit structure.\nEffective Date: 01.07.2022 | Policy Code: ARV COR |EOP_LCP|002|010722\nCRITICAL CONVEYANCE CLAUSES:\na. Company Car Beneficiaries: Employees who utilize a company-issued vehicle can claim local conveyance reimbursements only if their travel targets a destination sitting entirely outside their respective City/Town Municipal Corporation or Gram Panchayat Limits.\nb. THE AHMEDABAD EXCLUSION RULE: Employees whose regular workplace is located within Ahmedabad are strictly prohibited from claiming any local conveyance reimbursements for traveling to Santej, Raipur, Gomtipur, or any other functional business units situated in the geographical vicinity of Ahmedabad city.\nc. Non-Company Car Owners: Employees who do not have a company car are reimbursed for all valid local conveyance costs incurred within the city limits for business transit, excluding their daily commute to and from their residence to their regular base office.",
