    "section": "PAYOUT RATES, CLAIMS & AUDITS",
    "chunkType": "rule",
    "text": "REIMBURSEMENT PAYOUT RATES:\n• Personal Four-Wheeler (Car): Rs. 10.00 per kilometer.\n• Personal Two-Wheeler (Bike/Scooter): Rs. 5.00 per kilometer.\n• Hired Taxis: Reimbursed on actual costs as declared in the tracking panel. Requires valid receipts and corporate vouchers to be attached to the claim file.\nSYSTEM CLAIM WORKFLOW:\nClaims must be processed through the online system path: Orapps $\nightarrow$ ESMS $\nightarrow$ Entry $\nightarrow$ Conveyance Expense. The employee inputs total kilometers run during the day. The tool automatically deducts the baseline to-and-fro kilometer distance between their residence and their regular assigned office location.\nMANAGEMENT AUDIT RULES:\na. Location Applicability: These payout numbers are uniform across all operations throughout India.\nb. Carpooling rules: If multiple employees travel inside the same vehicle, only the single individual who actually owns the vehicle or paid the cash layout can file the claim.\nc. Manager Approval: Expenses require verification and approval from an employee holding a BM grade or above in that department. Forging documents or misrepresenting mileage results in strict disciplinary action. Management can change this structure at any point without notice. Queries should route to active Business HR teams.",
