    "text": "ARV|ELC_SHA|008|010422\nPolicy incorporates the legislation titled The Sexual Harassment of Women at Workplace (Prevention,\nProhibition and Redressal) Act, (defined as “Act”) and its Rules (defined as “Rules”) notified and\npublished on 9th December 2013.\nPREAMBLE:\nWe, Arvind group of companies (“Arvind”), respect the dignity of all employees and are committed to providing\na safe workplace that enables employees to work, in a conducive environment, free from gender bias and\nsexual harassment. When it comes to ethical conduct, all of us at Arvind distinguish ourselves by the way in\nwhich we handle ourselves every day on the job. Towards this, it is essential that each employeedeals with their\ncolleagues and third parties with full fairness and respect and realizes that his/her behaviour will be\nattributable to Arvind and can affect its inward and outward reputation.",
