    "section": "OBJECTIVE / PURPOSE",
    "chunkType": "rule",
    "text": "OBJECTIVE / PURPOSE:\nThis policy has been framed with a view to:\n1.\nTo promote a workplace based on equality and respect.\n2.\nTo provide a safe and congenial work environment.\n3.\nTo prevent sexual harassment.\n4.\nTo provide the procedure for the redressal of complaints pertaining to sexual harassment.\n5.\nTo raise awareness around the implications and outcome of sexual harassment.\n6.\nTo ensure protection against retaliation to complainants, witnesses, committee members and\nother employees involved in prevention and complaint resolution.\n7.\nTo curb abetment in any act of sexual harassment.\n8.\nTo prohibit workplace sexual harassment through an effectively communicated policy.",
