    "section": "CONSENSUAL RELATIONS",
    "chunkType": "rule",
    "text": "CONSENSUAL RELATIONS\nArvind discourages any kind of romantic or sexual relationships amongst employees at workplace, as this could\nlead to conflicts at work. However, if any such relationship, particularly between any member at supervisory\ncapacity and his/her staff (any employee who reports directly/indirectly to tha t person) develops, both the\nmember at supervisory capacity and staff shall notify to HR of such a relation. This is to ensure that the\nreporting chain is altered and that no direct or indirect reporting relationship continues.",
