    "text": "APPROACHING THE POLICE\nA CT is not barred from referring the matter to any other appropriate authority including law enforcement\nagencies, such as the police, as the CT may deem fit. In case of an Aggrieved Woman, Arvind will support to\nfile the same with the police upon request.\nPrivate & Confidential\nOnly for Internal Circulation\nPage 8\nHR Policy\nClassification:\nInternal\nIssue Date:\n31.03.2022\nEffective From:\n01.05.2025\nPolicy Number:",
