    "text": "SEXUAL HARASSMENT PREVENTION POLICY (POSH):\nLegal Grounding: This policy incorporates the central legislation titled 'The Sexual Harassment of Women at Workplace (Prevention, Prohibition and Redressal) Act, 2013' and its associated operating rules.\nPreamble: Arvind group of companies is committed to providing a safe workplace free from gender bias and sexual harassment, respecting the core dignity of all workers. Behavioral infractions are directly attributable to Arvind and impact corporate reputation.\nScope of Protection: \n1. All individuals employed at Arvind on a regular, temporary, ad-hoc, daily-wage, or voluntary basis, including contractors, co-workers, probationers, trainees, and apprentices.\n2. Third parties, clients, and physical visitors across all operational business units, including foreign nationals.\nCore Objectives: Frame an equality-based workplace, ensure zero harassment, set crystal-clear redressal complaint structures, raise legal awareness, and guarantee complete protection against retaliation for complainants, committee members, and corporate witnesses.",
