    "text": "POLICY EXTENSIONS & VOCABULARY:\nCompanion Policies: Must be cross-referenced with the Code of Conduct, Whistleblower policy, and employee disciplinary guidelines.\nExtended Workplace Scope: Protections apply inside regular offices and across extended business loops: work transit transport, company guest houses, hotels, corporate parties, off-sites, client meetings, training rooms, out-bound tours, or any residential dwelling place visited in the course of duty.\nCore Abbreviations:\n• CT: Complainant (Any individual of any gender - male, female, or transgender - lodging a complaint).\n• AIC: Arvind Internal Complaints Committee.\n• RE: Respondent (The individual against whom harassment allegations are filed).\n• Aggrieved Woman: Any woman of any age, employee or outsider, alleging exposure to sexual harassment inside an Arvind touchpoint.",
