    "chunkType": "rule",
    "text": "GRIEVANCE INTAKE WORKFLOW:\nGender Neutrality: The policy is fully gender-neutral, protecting men, women, and transgender employees with equal rigor, and explicitly prohibits same-sex harassment.\nIncapacity Exceptions: If a victim is physically or mentally incapable of lodging an entry, complaints can be filed by a relative, friend, co-worker, guardian, or specialized treating educator with valid written consent. If the victim is deceased, legal heirs can sign off on the intake process.\nREPORTING INTAKE ENDPOINTS:\nSubmissions can route through line managers, Business Unit HR leads, or centralized third-party whistleblower helpline nodes:\n• Helpline Phone: 18002008301 (Toll-Free)\n• Helpline Email: arvind@ethicshelpline.in\n• Helpline Web Portal: www.in.kpmg.com/ethicshelpline/arvind/\nAnonymous complaints are completely blocked from consideration by the AIC; all entries require valid true signatures or certified true email headers.",
