    "text": "INTERIM MITIGATION MATRIX (PENDING INQUIRY):\nAt the Complainant's written request, the AIC can immediately mandate the following interim measures:\na. Immediate access to medical help and mental health counseling.\nb. Physical transfer of either party to alternate office blocks, floors, or authorizing a Work-From-Home setup.\nc. Provide up to 3 months of paid safety leave, which is entirely separate from their accrued statutory leave balance.\nd. Execution of immediate supervisory suspension (the Respondent cannot process performance appraisals or sit in line management hierarchies for the Complainant).\ne. Out-system protection: If the Respondent is a third-party partner, they are legally barred from entry into all Arvind industrial facilities.\nNON-AGGRIEVED WOMAN CLAUSE:\nIf a complaint is filed by a male or transgender individual, the case inquiry is led directly by the Central HR Department (not the AIC) under standard company misconduct codes. Strict confidentiality is maintained throughout.",
